      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──今天是春季粉丝大感谢祭！\n这是一个邀请粉丝来特雷森学园的\n大型交流活动，但今年──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6d981858742825ed1b5d66abba194658b714fa81d4bfc9a7c6435412e9a1d29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
