    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa9a607893ca2530afaae7c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一直是为了替自己的“现在”留下痕迹，\n才集中心力在比赛中全力奔跑，\n脑中只想着要赢过对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8220a3e801e2745f1f5984b8ee4baacb5561d57a5ced2d4d2a263dfe53eec1e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
