    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b87224eb72a4511f69f3f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想着不断与可敬的强敌们比赛，\n不断增强我自身的光芒，\n最后走出一条属于我的独有光迹──",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb43fae5d57483349fad93d58e6e703333421210dd58327e5a60fca3f2388f7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
